    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liang Xun",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "True..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Retrieving the Grandmaster's sword is, of course, an urgent matter, but the bigger headache is what to do with it afterwards."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You don't want it at Yumen. Perhaps you speak for the Sui Regulator, perhaps it's your judgment as advisor to Yumen, but the Lord Exorcist won't let it go."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You needed someone who could take the sword, someone both sides can live with."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You just happen to have an oath-brother who is a kung fu master, and he just happens to be in Yumen."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It didn't take much effort to guide the girl to the clinic where Huai Tianpei worked, in order to ensure his involvement."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liang Xun",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "From Shangshu to Yumen, you always get your old friends to solve your problems. Isn't that a little lazy?"
