    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liang Xun",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Never mind, no need to tell me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*sigh*..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No matter how many strings you pulled behind the scenes, it was always his lifelong wish to fight the best and become the best. He might even thank you for setting the stage, if he knew."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liang Xun",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We are all doing what we wanted to, even if things often don't turn out the way we want."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "After all these years, perhaps he's the one who's closest to his oldest dreams."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "'Achieve one thing in life.' Easy for him to say..."
    },
    {
