    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Earlier that day..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Qiubai",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Today's the day, isn't it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Are you ready?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Qiubai",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The veterans say Yumen has been through many crises in the past, but nothing on this scale."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Qiubai",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Not even you know what's going to come of it, do you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Things are more complicated than meets the eye."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "From Jiangqi to Yumen, how many times has she seen danger, seen her life hang by a thread?\nYet she did not die in the wilderness, nor did she become like the Shanhaizhong.\nWhat is it that has kept her going?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Qiubai",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This city has treated me well. I should do something for it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Qiubai",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Before that, however, I must answer to myself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Qiubai",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You said that you would fight me whenever I felt up to it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I did."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Strike me, if you're ready."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Qiubai",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Qiubai takes a step back, focuses, and raises her sword.\nShe knows that he knows her every move like the back of his hand."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "An eye for an eye.\nIs there wisdom in the saying, or is it simply a result?\nHow many people have fed the fins by the river fort? Should their families seek revenge on her father?\nHow many people would seek revenge on her, if she killed this one in front of her for the sake of her own revenge?\nThe cycle of vengeance never ends."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Should it really be hate that keeps her going?\nHow long has she been thinking about that question? The five years that she has been around this man, seeing all that he saw?\nNo, longer than that.\nHer sword has seen blood every step of the way from Jiangqi to Yumen. How would she judge those dead by it?\nThat is why she came to Yumen, for revenge, and to learn.\nExact what must be exacted, and discern what must be discerned."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The sword is pulled back abruptly.\nIt leaves her hand and falls into a nearby ditch, sending a pack of fowlbeasts scattering in all directions.\nThe violence of the move almost injures her, showing none of her usual grace in practice or battle.\nHer expression, however, is one of satisfaction."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Qiubai",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That will do."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Qiubai",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The sword has been thrust. It couldn't have killed you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Correct."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Qiubai",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I didn't let go of vengeance because I can't kill you, though."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Qiubai",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's just not worth my sword anymore."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It seems you have made great strides in the past three years."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Huai Tianpei",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We've said too much."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I just..."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Chongyue stops mid-sentence.\nHis opponent is injured. A few more words would give him time to adjust his breathing.\nBut he soon realizes that such kindness would be an insult to his opponent.\nThere is no such thing as a truly fair fight.\nCast away irrelevant thoughts, and give all for victory. That is what 'fair' is."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Let's begin."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Huai Tianpei clutches his fist, feeling the lines etched into his palm.\nThey are the marks of forty years of kung fu practice, his pride, his very emblem.\nHe's waited three years for this fight, but the preparation for it began on his first day studying kung fu."
    },
